# Card Crest runs as a static site, so the browser needs no secrets. Only these server-side
# values exist, and they are set in Supabase (never committed, never placed in js/config.js).

# --- Supabase Edge Function secrets (supabase secrets set NAME=value) ---
GATEWAY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=        # from the payment gateway dashboard (Razorpay: Settings > Webhooks)
GATEWAY_KEY_ID=                # live mode only: used to create orders and payouts
GATEWAY_KEY_SECRET=            # live mode only
# SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are injected into Edge Functions automatically.

# --- Test mode (what is switched on today) ---
# select value from mk_settings where key = 'gateway_mode';   -- 'test'
# In test mode the site's test checkout feeds mk_apply_payment() directly and no gateway is called.
